msgctxt "No known user"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "User avatar"
msgstr "Avatar pengguna"

msgid ""
"This e-mail address is already in use. Please supply a different e-mail "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Alamat surel ini sudah digunakan. Silakan gunakan alamat surel yang berbeda."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please pick something else."
msgstr "Nama pengguna ini sudah digunakan. Silakan pilih yang lain."

msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Nama lengkap"

msgid "Name is also used in version control commits."
msgstr "Nama juga digunakan dalam komit kontrol versi."

msgid "Commit e-mail"
msgstr "Surel komit"

msgid "Use account e-mail address"
msgstr "Gunakan alamat surel akun"

msgid ""
"Used in version-control commits. The address stays in the repository forever "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Digunakan dalam komit pengendalian versi. Alamat tetap dalam repositori "
"selamanya setelah perubahan dikomit oleh Weblate."

msgid "Commit name"
msgstr "Nama komit"

msgid ""
"Used in version control commits. The name stays in the repository forever, "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Digunakan dalam komit pengontrol versi. Alamat tetap dalam repositori "
"selamanya setelah perubahan dikomit oleh Weblate."

msgid "Public e-mail"
msgstr "Surel publik"

msgid "Hide e-mail address from public view"
msgstr "Sembunyikan alamat surel dari pandangan publik"

#, python-format
msgid "Component list: %s"
msgstr "Daftar komponen: %s"

msgid "Account e-mail"
msgstr "Surel akun"

msgid ""
"Used for e-mail notifications and as a commit e-mail if it is not configured "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Digunakan dalam notifikasi surel dan sebagai surel komit jika tidak "
"dikonfigurasikan di bawah."

msgid "Human verification"
msgstr "Verifikasi manusia"

#, python-format
msgctxt ""
"Question for a mathematics-based CAPTCHA, the %s is an arithmetic problem"
msgid "What is %s?"
msgstr "Apa itu %s?"

#. Translators: Shown on wrong answer to the mathematics-based CAPTCHA
msgid "That was not correct, please try again."
msgstr "Itu tidak benar, silakan coba lagi."

msgid "Validation failed, please try again."
msgstr "Validasi gagal, silakan coba lagi."

msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Subjek"

msgid "Your name"
msgstr "Nama Anda"

msgid "Your e-mail"
msgstr "Surel Anda"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Pesan"

msgid ""
"Please contact us in English. Otherwise, we might not process your request."
msgstr ""
"Silakan hubungi kami dalam Inggris. Jika tidak, kami mungkin tidak memproses "
"permintaan Anda."

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "Surel"

msgid "An e-mail with a confirmation link will be sent here."
msgstr "Surel dengan tautan konfirmasi akan dikirim di sini."

msgid "New password"
msgstr "Kata sandi baru"

msgid "New password confirmation"
msgstr "Konfirmasi kata sandi baru"

msgid "Regenerate API key"
msgstr "Hasilkan ulang kunci API"

msgid ""
"Leave enabled to revoke the current API key and generate a new one. This is "
"recommended if you suspect your password was compromised. Disable it to keep "
"your current API key active after changing your password."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan aktif untuk mencabut kunci API saat ini dan membuat yang baru. Hal "
"ini disarankan jika Anda menduga kata sandi Anda telah bocor. Nonaktifkan "
"opsi ini agar kunci API Anda tetap aktif setelah mengganti kata sandi."

msgid "Your password has been changed."
msgstr "Kata sandi Anda telah diubah."

msgid "Current password"
msgstr "Kata sandi saat ini"

msgid "Leave empty if you have not set a password yet."
msgstr "Biarkan kosong jika Anda belum mengatur kata sandi."

msgid "You have entered an invalid password."
msgstr "Anda memasukkan kata sandi yang tidak valid."

msgid "Username or e-mail"
msgstr "Nama pengguna atau surel"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kata sandi"

msgid "Please enter the correct username and password."
msgstr "Silakan masukkan nama pengguna dan kata sandi yang benar."

msgid "This account is inactive."
msgstr "Akun ini tidak aktif."

msgid "Component wide notifications"
msgstr "Notifikasi seluruh komponen"

msgid "Translation notifications"
msgstr "Notifikasi terjemahan"

msgid "Use default setting"
msgstr "Gunakan pengaturan bawaan"

msgid "Other projects"
msgstr "Proyek lain"

msgid "Watched projects"
msgstr "Proyek yang dipantau"

msgid "Managed projects"
msgstr "Proyek yang dikelola"

msgid "Project: {}"
msgstr "Proyek: {}"

msgid "Component: {}"
msgstr "Komponen: {}"

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan menerima notifikasi setiap ada pembaruan pada proyek yang tidak "
"Anda pantau."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in your watched "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan menerima notifikasi setiap ada pembaruan pada proyek yang Anda "
"pantau."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in projects where you "
"have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan menerima notifikasi untuk setiap peristiwa semacam itu dalam "
"proyek di mana Anda memiliki izin admin."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan menerima notifikasi setiap ada peristiwa seperti itu pada "
"%(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Anda akan menerima notifikasi untuk setiap peristiwa seperti itu dalam "
"%(component)s."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya akan menerima notifikasi berikut untuk bahasa yang Anda "
"terjemahkan pada proyek yang tidak Anda pantau."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"your watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya akan menerima notifikasi berikut untuk bahasa yang Anda "
"terjemahkan pada proyek yang Anda pantau."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"projects where you have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya akan menerima notifikasi ini untuk bahasa yang Anda terjemahkan "
"dimana Anda punya hak admin."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya akan menerima notifikasi berikut untuk bahasa yang Anda "
"terjemahkan dalam %(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Anda hanya akan menerima notifikasi berikut untuk bahasa yang Anda "
"terjemahkan dalam %(component)s."

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Nama pengguna"

msgid "Date joined"
msgstr "Tanggal bergabung"

msgid "Translations made"
msgstr "Terjemahan dibuat"

msgid "Suggestions made"
msgstr "Saran dibuat"

msgid "Comments made"
msgstr "Komentar dibuat"

msgid "Screenshots uploaded"
msgstr "Tangkapan layar diunggah"

msgid "The chosen sorting is not supported."
msgstr "Penyortiran yang dipilih tidak didukung."

msgid "Team"
msgstr "Tim"

msgid "Add to a team"
msgstr "Tambahkan ke tim"

msgid "Name your authentication app"
msgstr "Beri nama aplikasi autentikasi Anda"

msgid "Verify the code from the app"
msgstr "Verifikasikan kode dari aplikasi"

msgid "Discard previously configured authentication apps"
msgstr "Buang aplikasi autentikasi yang dikonfigurasikan sebelumnya"

msgid ""
"All previously configured authentication apps will be discarded upon "
"verification of the new app."
msgstr ""
"Semua aplikasi autentikasi yang dikonfigurasikan sebelumnya akan dibuang "
"setelah verifikasi aplikasi baru."

msgid ""
"Other two-factor methods (such as WebAuthn and security keys) won't be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Metode dua faktor lainnya (seperti WebAuthn dan kunci keamanan) tidak akan "
"terpengaruh."

msgid "The entered token is not valid."
msgstr "Token yang dimasukkan tidak valid."

msgid "Recovery token"
msgstr "Token pemulihan"

msgid ""
"Recovery codes can only be used once. Remember to mark used ones as expired."
msgstr ""
"Kode pemulihan hanya dapat digunakan sekali saja. Pastikan untuk menandai "
"yang lama sebagai kedaluwarsa."

msgid "Enter the code from the app"
msgstr "Masukkan kode dari aplikasi"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password changed."
msgstr "Kata sandi diubah."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Rate limit exceeded for {scope} at {path}."
msgstr "Batas laju terlampaui untuk {scope} pada {path}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Username changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Nama pengguna diubah dari {old} menjadi {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "E-mail changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Surel diubah dari {old} menjadi {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Full name changed from {old} to {new}."
msgstr "Nama lengkap diubah dari {old} menjadi {new}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password reset requested."
msgstr "Pengaturan ulang kata sandi diminta."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password reset confirmed, password turned off."
msgstr "Pengaturan ulang kata sandi dikonfirmasikan, kata sandi dinonaktifkan."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Configured sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Masuk dikonfigurasikan menggunakan ({method}:({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Removed sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Masuk dihapus menggunakan ({method}:({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Signed in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Masuk menggunakan ({method}:({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Signed in using {method} ({name}) from a new device."
msgstr "Masuk menggunakan ({method}:{name}) dari perangkat baru."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Somebody attempted to register with your e-mail."
msgstr "Seseorang mencoba mendaftarkan menggunakan surel Anda."

msgid "Somebody attempted to register using your e-mail address."
msgstr "Seseorang mencoba mendaftarkan menggunakan alamat surel Anda."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not sign in using {method} ({name})."
msgstr "Tidak dapat masuk menggunakan ({method}:({name})."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account locked due to many failed sign in attempts."
msgstr "Akun dikunci karena banyak percobaan masuk yang gagal."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account locked by the site administrator."
msgstr "Akun dikunci oleh administrator situs."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Account and all private data removed."
msgstr "Akun dan semua data privat dihapus."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Account removal confirmation sent to {email}."
msgstr "Konfirmasi penghapusan akun dikirim ke {email}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Agreement with General Terms and Conditions {date}."
msgstr "Perjanjian dengan Syarat dan Ketentuan Umum {date}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Invited to {site_title} by {username}."
msgstr "Diundang ke {site_title} oleh {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Accepted invitation from {username}."
msgstr "Undangan diterima dari {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Started trial period."
msgstr "Masa percobaan dimulai."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sent confirmation mail to {email}."
msgstr "Surat konfirmasi dikirim ke {email}."

msgid ""
"The system created a user to track authorship of translations uploaded by "
"other user."
msgstr ""
"Sistem telah membuat pengguna untuk melacak kepengarangan terjemahan yang "
"diunggah oleh pengguna lain."

msgid ""
"Account created externally from weblate.org for access to purchased services."
msgstr "Akun dibuat di luar weblate.org untuk mengakses layanan terbeli."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Access to project {project} was blocked."
msgstr "Akses ke proyek {project} diblokir."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "User was enabled by administrator."
msgstr "Pengguna diaktifkan oleh administrator."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "User was disabled by administrator."
msgstr "Pengguna dinonaktifkan oleh administrator."

msgid "User was disabled because the access has expired."
msgstr "Pengguna dinonaktifkan karena aksesnya telah kedaluwarsa."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was added to the site-wide {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Pengguna ditambahkan ke tim {team} di seluruh situs oleh {username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User access to the site-wide {team} team was changed by {username}."
msgstr ""
"Akses pengguna ke tim {team} untuk seluruh situs telah diubah oleh "
"{username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was removed from the site-wide {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Pengguna dihapus dari tim {team} di seluruh situs oleh {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Superuser privileges granted."
msgstr "Hak akses superuser diberikan."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Superuser privileges revoked."
msgstr "Hak akses superuser dicabut."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Semiannual support status review was displayed."
msgstr "Tinjauan status dukungan setengah tahunan ditampilkan."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was added to the {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Pengguna ditambahkan ke {team} oleh {username}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "User access to the {team} team was changed by {username}."
msgstr "Akses pengguna ke tim {team} telah diubah oleh {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "User was removed from the {team} team by {username}."
msgstr "Pengguna dikeluarkan dari tim {team} oleh {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Project token for {project} was created."
msgstr "Token proyek untuk {project} telah dibuat."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Project token for {project} was removed."
msgstr "Token proyek untuk {project} telah dihapus."

msgid "Two-factor authentication recovery codes were generated"
msgstr "Kode pemulihan autentikasi dua faktor dihasilkan"

msgid "Two-factor authentication recovery codes were viewed"
msgstr "Kode pemulihan autentikasi dua faktor dilihat"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication added: {device}"
msgstr "Autentikasi dua faktor ditambahkan: {device}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication removed: {device}"
msgstr "Autentikasi dua faktor dihapus: {device}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication sign in using {device}"
msgstr "Masuk dengan autentikasi dua faktor menggunakan {device}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed using {device_type}"
msgstr "Autentikasi dua faktor gagal menggunakan {device_type}"

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Configured password to sign in."
msgstr "Kata sandi yang dikonfigurasikan untuk masuk."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Signed in using password."
msgstr "Masuk menggunakan kata sandi."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Signed in using password from a new device."
msgstr "Masuk menggunakan kata sandi dari perangkat baru."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Could not sign in using password."
msgstr "Tidak dapat masuk menggunakan kata sandi."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Invited to {project} by {username}."
msgstr "Diundang ke {project} oleh {username}."

#. Translators: Audit log entry
msgid "Password configured."
msgstr "Kata sandi dikonfigurasikan."

msgid "To restore access to your account, please reset your password."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memulihkan akses ke akun Anda, silakan atur ulang kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Please contact project maintainers if you feel this is inappropriate."
msgstr "Silakan hubungi pemelihara proyek jika Anda merasa ini keliru."

msgid "If it was you, reset your password to regain access to your account."
msgstr ""
"Jika itu adalah Anda, atur ulang sandi Anda untuk mendapatkan kembali akses "
"ke akun Anda."

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "PC"
msgstr "PC"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Lainnya"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Generic Smartphone"
msgstr "Smartphone Generik"

msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "Generic Feature Phone"
msgstr "Feature Phone Generik"

#. Translators: User agent device type
msgctxt "User agent device type"
msgid "iOS-Device"
msgstr "Perangkat iOS"

msgid "Account activity"
msgstr "Aktivitas akun"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Triggered by {username}."
msgstr "Dipicu oleh {username}."

msgid "Total strings"
msgstr "Jumlah string"

msgid "Unfinished strings"
msgstr "String yang belum selesai"

msgid "Unfinished words"
msgstr "Kata yang belum selesai"

msgid "Unfinished characters"
msgstr "Karakter yang belum selesai"

msgid "Untranslated strings"
msgstr "String yang belum diterjemahkan"

msgid "Checks"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan"

msgid "Suggestions"
msgstr "Saran"

msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Komentar"

msgid "Invalid listing column selection."
msgstr "Pemilihan kolom daftar tidak valid."

msgid "Interface Language"
msgstr "Bahasa Antarmuka"

msgid "Translated languages"
msgstr "Bahasa yang diterjemahkan"

msgid ""
"Choose the languages you can translate to. These will be offered to you on "
"the dashboard for easier access to your chosen translations."
msgstr ""
"Pilih bahasa yang dapat Anda terjemahkan. Ini akan ditawarkan kepada Anda di "
"dasbor untuk akses yang lebih mudah ke terjemahan pilihan Anda."

msgid "Secondary languages"
msgstr "Bahasa sekunder"

msgid ""
"Choose languages you can understand, strings in those languages will be "
"shown in addition to the source string."
msgstr ""
"Pilih bahasa yang dapat Anda pahami, string dalam bahasa tersebut akan "
"ditampilkan di dekat string sumber."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid "Hide completed translations on the dashboard"
msgstr "Sembunyikan terjemahan yang sudah selesai di dasbor"

msgid "Show secondary translations in the Zen mode"
msgstr "Tampilkan terjemahan sekunder dalam mode Zen"

msgid "Hide source if a secondary translation exists"
msgstr "Sembunyikan sumber jika ada terjemahan sekunder"

msgid "Show all columns in lists using horizontal scrolling"
msgstr "Tampilkan semua kolom dalam daftar menggunakan pengguliran horizontal"

msgid ""
"Instead of hiding columns on narrow screens, keep all columns and scroll the "
"table horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Alih-alih menyembunyikan kolom pada layar sempit, pertahankan semua kolom "
"dan gulir tabel secara horizontal."

msgid "Visible columns in lists"
msgstr "Kolom yang terlihat dalam daftar"

msgid ""
"Choose which statistics columns are shown in project, component, and "
"language lists."
msgstr ""
"Pilih kolom statistik mana yang ditampilkan dalam daftar proyek, komponen, "
"dan bahasa."

msgid "Editor link"
msgstr "Tautan penyuntingan"

msgid ""
"Enter a custom URL to be used as link to the source code. You can use "
"{{branch}} for branch, {{filename}} and {{line}} as filename and line "
"placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan URL khusus untuk digunakan sebagai tautan ke kode sumber. Anda "
"dapat menggunakan {{branch}} untuk cabang, {{filename}} dan {{line}} sebagai "
"nama berkas dan tempat pengganti baris."

msgid "Translation editor mode"
msgstr "Mode penyuntingan terjemahan"

msgid "Full editor"
msgstr "Penyuntingan penuh"

msgid "Zen mode"
msgstr "Mode Zen"

msgid "Zen editor mode"
msgstr "Mode penyuntingan Zen"

msgid "Top to bottom"
msgstr "Atas ke bawah"

msgid "Side by side"
msgstr "Bersebelahan"

msgid "Special characters"
msgstr "Karakter spesial"

msgid ""
"You can specify additional special visual keyboard characters to be shown "
"while translating. It can be useful for characters you use frequently, but "
"are hard to type on your keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menentukan karakter papan ketik visual spesial tambahan yang akan "
"ditampilkan saat menerjemahkan. Itu dapat berguna untuk karakter yang sering "
"Anda gunakan, tetapi sulit diketik pada papan ketik Anda."

msgid "Number of nearby strings"
msgstr "Jumlah string terdekat"

msgid "Number of nearby strings to show in each direction in the full editor."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah string terdekat untuk ditampilkan di tiap arah di dalam penyuntingan "
"lengkap."

msgid "Automatically watch projects on contribution"
msgstr "Pantau proyek secara otomatis berdasarkan kontribusi"

msgid ""
"Projects are added to your watched projects when you contribute to them."
msgstr ""
"Proyek akan ditambahkan ke proyek yang Anda pantau ketika Anda berkontribusi "
"pada proyek tersebut."

msgid "Contribute to personal translation memory"
msgstr "Kontribusikan pada memori terjemahan pribadi"

msgid ""
"Allow your translations to be added to your personal translation memory."
msgstr ""
"Izinkan terjemahan Anda untuk menambahkan ke dalam memori terjemahan pribadi "
"Anda."

msgid "Watched translations"
msgstr "Terjemahan yang dipantau"

msgid "All component lists"
msgstr "Semua daftar komponen"

msgid "Component list"
msgstr "Daftar komponen"

msgid "Suggested translations"
msgstr "Terjemahan yang disarankan"

msgid "Default dashboard view"
msgstr "Tampilan dasbor bawaan"

msgid "Default component list"
msgstr "Daftar komponen bawaan"

msgid ""
"You can receive notifications for watched projects and they are shown on the "
"dashboard by default."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menerima notifikasi untuk proyek yang dipantau dan mereka akan "
"ditampilkan di dasbor secara bawaan."

msgid "Website URL"
msgstr "URL Situs Web"

msgid "Contact URL"
msgstr "URL Kontak"

msgid ""
"Link to contact you online using services like Signal, SimpleX or Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Tautkan untuk menghubungi Anda secara daring menggunakan Signal, SimpleX, "
"atau Telegram."

msgid "Liberapay username"
msgstr "Nama pengguna Liberapay"

msgid ""
"Liberapay is a platform to donate money to teams, organizations and "
"individuals."
msgstr ""
"Liberapay adalah platform untuk mendonasikan uang kepada tim, organisasi, "
"dan individu."

msgid "Fediverse URL"
