"Sends notifications to external services based on selected events, following "
"the Standard Webhooks specification."
msgstr ""
"Mengirimkan notifikasi ke layanan eksternal berdasarkan peristiwa yang "
"dipilih, mengikuti spesifikasi Pengait Web Standar."

